MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec
# ...but QuickLook3.spec is the hand-maintained single source of truth for PyInstaller
# across macOS/Linux/Windows (see AGENTS.md "Packaging"). It must stay versioned.
!QuickLook3.spec

