/site/

# Sample/science data used for manual testing. Never commit these:
#  - they are large (a 170 MB cube exceeds GitHub's 100 MiB per-file hard limit)
#  - they include other PIs' observations (e.g. JWST program 01266), which are not
#    ours to redistribute. Fetch from MAST / KOA by program ID instead.
example/

# Working notes for the in-progress security review. Deliberately NOT versioned:
# it enumerates unfixed weaknesses, and this repository is public.
/security_review_plan.md
